# Anything the image should build for itself rather than inherit from a
# developer's machine. node_modules in particular is platform-specific: bcrypt
# and Prisma's engines are native, and a macOS build copied into a Linux image
# fails at require() time with an error that names neither.
node_modules
**/node_modules
dist
**/dist
.turbo
**/.turbo
coverage
**/coverage
apps/api/generated
.git
.github
.husky
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
*.log
.DS_Store
**/.DS_Store
